WEBVTT

00:11:58.564 --> 00:12:02.500
qe ne mendojme si jo te lumtur.

00:12:02.500 --> 00:12:05.769
Por cila eshte ne fakt dallimi midis ketyre akordeve?

00:12:05.769 --> 00:12:08.006
Jane vetem keto dy nota ne mes.

00:12:08.006 --> 00:12:10.971
Eshte E natyrale,

00:12:10.971 --> 00:12:15.671
dhe 659 vibrime per sekond,

00:12:15.687 --> 00:12:20.375
apo E e rrafshet, te 622.

00:12:20.375 --> 00:12:26.000
Pra dallimi i madh mes gezimit dhe hidherimit njerezor?

00:12:26.000 --> 00:12:28.750
37 vibrime.

00:12:28.750 --> 00:12:32.667
Pra ju mund te shihni ne nje sistem si ky